message: "If you use these motions in research or a published project, please cite the archive."
type: dataset
title: "Sign Language Mocap Archive"
abstract: >-
  Motion capture of American Sign Language signs and fingerspelling, recorded
  with an Xsens Link suit and StretchSense gloves, cleaned in Blender and
  released as FBX for Blender, Unreal Engine and Mixamo-compatible rigs.
authors:
  - name: "Studio Galt"
